        {
          "type": "TextualBody",
          "label": "Recto",
          "value": "<p>1. ] and the debtors took him to [</p>\n<p>2.].. On the slave and kindness [</p>\n<p>3. ]he reports that and the lofty resolution [regarding this if God wills]</p>\n<p>4. ]<span lang=\"X-NONE\"> Praise</span> be to God, who is one, and his blessings on our Master</p>\n<p>5. M\u016b\u1e25ammad, his Prophet, and his progeny, and peace. God is sufficient for us, and it is upon him that we rely.</p>",
